      "text": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef main():\n    X = np.load('vectors.npy').astype(np.float64)\n    n = X.shape[0]\n\n    block_size = 200\n    total = 0.0\n\n    for start in range(0, n, block_size):\n        end = min(start + block_size, n)\n        block = X[start:end]  # shape (b, d)\n\n        # compute squared distances between block and all rows\n        # ||a-b||^2 = ||a||^2 + ||b||^2 - 2 a.b\n        diff_sq = (block[:, None, :] - X[None, :, :]) ** 2\n        dist = np.sqrt(diff_sq.sum(axis=2))\n        total += dist.sum()\n\n    # total is a numpy float64 scalar; convert to Decimal-like exact printing\n    print(f\"TOTAL:{total:.10f}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
